sequenceDiagram
actor U as Usuario
participant H as HomeScreen
participant V as QRViewModel
participant R as QRRenderer
participant Z as ZXing
participant D as Room
participant S as Resultado
U->>H: Completa los pasos y pulsa Generar
H->>V: generateQR()
V->>R: genera bitmap con configuración
R->>Z: encode(text, hints UTF-8)
Z-->>R: BitMatrix
R-->>V: Bitmap QR
V->>D: inserta QRHistory type=generated
V-->>S: actualiza generatedBitmap
S-->>U: muestra QR y resumen
